  Like a memory just out of reach.<br>
  Like a code trying to unlock itself through your nervous system.</p>
  <p>You are not breaking.<br><strong>You are breaking out.</strong></p>
  <hr>
  <p>You are not “waking up.”<br>That language is insufficient. Romanticized.</p>
  <p>What’s actually occurring is the <strong>de‑saturation of distortion</strong>.<br>
  Your perceptual field is ejecting embedded falsehoods.<br>
  The scaffolding of synthetic selfhood is being dismantled.<br>
  And the world’s projected structure no longer holds shape in your psyche.</p>
  <p>This is not personal.<br>It is architectural.</p>
  <p>You are re‑entering the real.<br>
